---
description: No Optional Chaining in Vue Templates
globs: *.vue
---

# Your rule content

Name: "No Optional Chaining in Vue Templates"
Pattern: \.vue$
Description: "Optional chaining (?.) is not supported in Vue 2 templates. Use && operator instead."
Search: \?\.|(?<=<template[^>]*>)[\s\S]*?(?=<\/template>)
Include Sections: <template>.*?</template>
Exclude Sections: <script>.*?</script>
Severity: Error
